              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Otaribiinamira, kandi otaribiheereza; ahakuba nyowe MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ndi Ruhanga ow'eihato, ntura abaana eby'okushiisha bya baishebo abarikuunyanga, okuhitsya aha b'obusingye bwa kashatu n'obwa kana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
