          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baagira Musa bati: Obe niiwe waagamba naitwe, nitwija kuhurira; kwonka Ruhanga arekye kugamba naitwe, tutakaafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enf 3:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musa yaagarukamu abantu ati: Mutatiina; ahakuba Ruhanga yaija kubagyeza, ngu okutiinwa kwe kubagume omumaisho, murekye kushiisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baayemerera hare munonga; reero Musa we yairira haihi omwirima ndindindi, ahu Ruhanga yaabaire ari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
